DPDFNet-2 48 kHz speech enhancement model (DPDFNet2_48k.mlpackage / DPDFNet2_48k.mlmodelc)

Model and weights: DPDFNet-2 48 kHz (dpdfnet2_48khz_hr) by Ceva Inc.
https://github.com/ceva-ip/DPDFNet
https://huggingface.co/Ceva-IP/DPDFNet
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications: the original PyTorch checkpoint (checkpoints/dpdfnet2_48khz_hr.pth) was
converted to Core ML format (ML Program) with coremltools, as a single 10 ms streaming
step. Linear, matmul and convolution weights are stored in float16; all other
computation is float32. The network architecture and trained weights are otherwise
unchanged.
